      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "As an AI, I cannot provide a definitive judgment on material science beyond the reported data, but my role is to flag potential liabilities. Proceeding while aware of an unclassified material anomaly significantly increases the financial risk for the auction house. We could potentially limit the warranty or include a detailed disclaimer in the sale agreement, hedging the risk while still meeting the deadline. Ultimately, the decision to move vs. halt rests on your tolerance for material uncertainty versus the prestige of the sale.",
